# Double opt-in

The [interest form's project note](https://github.com/joelhooks/rat-stack/blob/main/.brain/projects/tokenmaxx-interest-form.svx) describes double opt-in: the visitor gets one confirmation email and is counted only after using its link.

The same note records why the link opens a page with a button rather than confirming on GET:

> Mail scanners follow links, and a GET that confirms would count a scanner as a person.
